OL,3,CAriana Grande to step back from public-
OL,4,Cfacing work after 'endless' scrutiny
OL,6,FAriana Grande will take a "step back"
OL,7,Ffrom public-facing work, following
OL,8,F"endless, ongoing public scrutiny".
OL,10,FThe pop singer, 33, was due to appear
OL,11,Fopposite her Wicked co-star Jonathan
OL,12,FBailey in a new production of Stephen
OL,13,FSondheim's critically acclaimed
OL,14,Fmusical, Sunday In The Park With
OL,15,FGeorge, at the Barbican in 2027.
OL,17,FThe Barbican show will still go ahead
OL,18,Fas planned and Grande's part will be
OL,19,Frecast, production company Empire
OL,20,FStreet Productions said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
