OL,3,CAriana Grande to step back from public-
OL,4,Cfacing work after 'endless' scrutiny
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after Grande
OL,7,Freleased the music video for Petal,
OL,8,Fthe title single from her newly
OL,9,Freleased eighth studio album, which
OL,10,Faugmented speculation about her health.
OL,12,FThe Thank U, Next singer's health and
OL,13,Fphysical appearance have been topics
OL,14,Fof speculation in recent years.
OL,16,FA representative for Grande told
OL,17,FPeople: "Ariana will be taking a step
OL,18,Fback from visibility after she
OL,19,Fcompletes the Eternal Sunshine Tour.
OL,26,@yD@IOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
