PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785829679
OL,3,CAriana Grande to step back from public-
OL,4,Cfacing work after 'endless' scrutiny
OL,6,F"She looks forward to finishing the
OL,7,Ftour and ending it on a high note,
OL,8,Fboth healthily and happily, and then
OL,9,Ftaking a much-deserved break from
OL,10,Fpublic-facing work and appearances,
OL,11,Fwhich has led to endless, ongoing
OL,12,Fpublic scrutiny.
OL,14,F"This tour has been a beautiful
OL,15,Fexperience for her. She loves her fans
OL,16,Fand has loved every minute of this
OL,17,Ftour so much."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUyD@NO]
