OL,3,CAriana Grande to step back from public-
OL,4,Cfacing work after 'endless' scrutiny
OL,6,FGrande is currently on her Eternal
OL,7,FSunshine tour, which will come to the
OL,8,FUK in August, with a 10-night
OL,9,Fresidency at London's The O2.
OL,11,FHer final London show on September 1
OL,12,Fwill also mark the end of the tour.
OL,14,FGrande has won three Grammy awards
OL,15,Famid a successful music career which
OL,16,Ftook off in 2013 after the release of
OL,17,Fher debut album, Yours Truly.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
