OL,3,CAriana Grande to step back from public-
OL,4,Cfacing work after 'endless' scrutiny
OL,6,FShe first found fame playing Cat
OL,7,FValentine on the Nickelodeon
OL,8,Ftelevision shows Victorious and Sam &
OL,9,FCat.
OL,11,FShe was nominated for an Oscar for her
OL,12,Frole as Glinda in the big-screen
OL,13,Fadaptation of Wicked.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
