OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785829679
OL,3,CAriana Grande to step back from public-
OL,4,Cfacing work after 'endless' scrutiny
OL,6,F"We wish her nothing but the best. The
OL,7,Fproduction will open at the Barbican
OL,8,Fin summer 2027 as planned, and casting
OL,9,Fwill be announced in due course."
OL,11,FThe original musical, created by
OL,12,FSondheim and James Lapine, debuted on
OL,13,FBroadway in 1984 starring Mandy
OL,14,FPatinkin and Bernadette Peters.
